'''Unstable Orbs''' are objects that appear during the fight with [[Akkha]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]], where they appear once he rejuvenates himself at the tail end of the fight. These hit the player for moderate damage, which can be slightly mitigated with [[Protect from Magic]]. In addition, they move in a single direction as indicated by the arrows under them, making their movements easy to predict.
